  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please add an event for when any player enters a station, including avatar stations.\nAs of right now, OnPlayerTriggerExit is unreliable due to how Unity handles Trigger Exit events when colliders are disabled. Players entering a station will turn off their collider. While creators can handle this (although painfully) with stations in the world, it is impossible to handle it when the station is an avatar station.\nRelated canny:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/sdk-bug-reports/p/playerlocal-collision-should-remain-on-players-in-stations",
